<h3>Memory Verse</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>&laquo;Pray without ceasing. Give thanks in all circumstances; for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus for you.&raquo;</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; 1 Thessalonians 5:17-18</p>
</div>

