<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord, teach me to pray.<br />
I do not know what to say, I do not know where to begin.<br />
Sometimes I get distracted, sometimes I grow bored,<br />
sometimes I feel as though I am speaking to myself.<br />
But you sought me first.<br />
You thirst for me before I thirst for you.<br />
Take my poor prayer and turn it into a dialogue of love.<br />
Teach me the prayer of adoration, of thanks, of praise.<br />
Teach me the prayer that intercedes for others.<br />
Teach me to persist like Monica, to trust like a child,<br />
to be still long enough to let you look at me.<br />
May my restless heart find rest in you,<br />
and may every surge of my heart rise toward your heart,<br />
until prayer becomes not something I do<br />
but someone I am.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

